# Same reason as NEMSweep.Web/wwwroot/_headers: Cloudflare Pages defaults static assets to
# max-age=14400, and docfx writes its stylesheet and script to stable filenames, so a theme change
# would not reach a returning reader for four hours.
#
# docfx fingerprints its own bundled chunks under public/ but not public/main.css or main.js, which
# are exactly the two files this project overrides, so the whole site revalidates rather than
# picking out the few that cannot.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
